&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　希薄化効果を有しないため、潜在株式調整後１株当たり当期純利益金額の算定に含めなかった潜在株式の概要&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 199.66666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;2016年３月31日取締役会決議に基づき発行した新株予約権&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;この概要は以下のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;・新株予約権の数&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; 1,560個&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -6px"&gt;・新株予約権の目的となる株式の種類&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;普通株式&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -6px"&gt;・新株予約権の目的となる株式の数&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; 156,000株&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -6px"&gt;・新株予約権の行使時の払込金額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; 94,000円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;・新株予約権の行使期間&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;自　2017年 ７月１日&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;至　2031年 ４月27日&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;2021年３月31日取締役会決議に基づき発行した新株予約権&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;この概要は以下のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;・新株予約権の数&lt;/p&gt;
